abstract: >
  An interactive network explorer mapping documented relationships between
  Community Supported Agriculture (CSA) and related actors across
  Berlin-Brandenburg, developed as part of the Berlin University Alliance
  X-Student Research Group "How can a box of vegetables weave places together?
  Rural-Urban food networks in the Berlin-Brandenburg area."
